<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Tally helps students keep track of coursework, deadlines, and weekly workload.">
  <title>{{title}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/landing.css">
</head>
<body class="landing-body">
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Tally home"><img src="/images/tally-mark.svg" alt="" width="34" height="34"><span>Tally</span></a>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav>
    <div class="header-actions"><a class="login-link" href="/login">Log in</a><a class="button button-small" href="/login/register">Register</a></div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">COURSEWORK TRACKER FOR STUDENTS</p>
        <h1>Keep track of<br>your coursework.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Tally brings assignments, due dates, and study plans together so you can see what needs your attention.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/login/register">Create an account</a><a class="text-link" href="/login">Already registered? Log in</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside" aria-label="What you can do with Tally">
        <h2>With Tally, you can</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><span>01</span><p>Keep assignments organized by course and due date</p></li>
          <li><span>02</span><p>See upcoming deadlines on a monthly calendar</p></li>
          <li><span>03</span><p>Plan what to work on with a study path</p></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-section" id="features">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FEATURES</p><h2>Coursework, in one place.</h2></div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Assignments</h3><p>Organize work by course, priority, due date, and estimated workload.</p></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Calendar</h3><p>Review upcoming assignment deadlines in a monthly view.</p></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>Study path</h3><p>Use a suggested path to decide what to focus on next.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" id="about">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT TALLY</p><h2>A clearer view of your schoolwork.</h2></div>
      <p>Tally is a coursework tracker for students. Add assignments yourself or import them, then use your dashboard, calendar, and study path to keep your week organized.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/images/tally-mark.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>Tally</span></a><span>Coursework tracker for students</span><a href="/login">Log in</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
